# The dependency audit CI runs on the image locks, and the same job runs the code
# scanner a contributor's merge request has to pass (threat model T32, T33). Compiled
# into tests/requirements-audit.lock with hashes, like every other lock here.
# bandit is a Python package on purpose: a pinned wheel with a hash is auditable. The
# secret scanner in that job is gitleaks, pinned by release checksum in the CI files,
# because it has no baseline to drift and currently reports nothing at all.
pip-audit
bandit
